---
title: Partials round
---

Test pages from the partials round. passthrough: each partial a file
beside its page, named as today, included with Markdoc's partial tag where
the ERB call was, its content as the earlier rounds' passthrough. native:
the same tag, with the content in Markdown and the asides of the notes
round; one shared partial lives in `shared/`, outside the content folder.
variable: a partial chosen by a variable. probe: one partial with a
heading, included twice.
